// A proportional bitmap font for the printable ASCII characters (0x20 to
// 0x7e), translated from an X11 font, by way of pico-dvi-rs. Each of the
// FONT_HEIGHT rows of font_bits is FONT_STRIDE bytes, with pixels packed
// least significant bit first. font_glyphs[c - 32] is the bit where glyph c
// starts in each row, plus its width in pixels << 16.

// This font was adapted from helvR10.bdf from the adobe-100dpi fonts repo
// from x11. It comes with the following COPYING notice:

